{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09982","headline":"登天目山下作 · 张万顷","name":"登天目山下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去岁离秦望，今冬使楚关。\n泪添天目水，发变海头山。\n别母乌南逝，辞兄雁北还。\n宦游偏不乐，长爲忆慈颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张万顷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}